    <!-- Setup steps and limits -->
    <string name="cmod_step_1">Download the APK from the Releases page of the Winlator Cmod project and install it.</string>
    <string name="cmod_step_2">Open Winlator once and wait for its first-time setup to finish.</string>
    <string name="cmod_step_3">Create a container, then create a shortcut for your game inside Winlator.</string>
    <string name="cmod_step_4">Use the frontend export option (Export to frontend) on that shortcut to save a .desktop file to shared storage.</string>
    <string name="cmod_step_5">Come back here, paste that file path into the test field and tap Launch shortcut.</string>
    <string name="cmod_limit_1">NexusPlay cannot create shortcuts. They must be made inside Winlator first.</string>
    <string name="cmod_limit_2">Android returns no result from the runtime, so NexusPlay cannot tell whether the game started or when it exits.</string>
    <string name="cmod_limit_3">Cmod has its own touch controls and controller support. The NexusPlay virtual gamepad cannot send input into it.</string>
    <string name="cmod_limit_4">This launch method comes from public sources and has not been confirmed on your device. The test field is how you confirm it.</string>
    <string name="official_step_1">Download the APK from the Releases page of the Winlator project and install it.</string>
    <string name="official_step_2">Open Winlator once and wait for its first-time setup to finish.</string>
    <string name="official_step_3">Create a container and add your game as a shortcut inside Winlator.</string>
    <string name="official_step_4">Start the game from the Winlator home screen shortcut.</string>
    <string name="official_limit_1">Official Winlator keeps its game screen private, so NexusPlay can open the app but cannot start a game in it.</string>
    <string name="official_limit_2">Some older Winlator Cmod builds also use the package name com.winlator. Whether a build accepts launches is read from your device, not assumed from the name.</string>
    <string name="official_limit_3">NexusPlay cannot send controller input into Winlator.</string>

